      "detail_main_html": "<main class=\"wrap\">\n<div class=\"detail-head\">\n<h1>\n<img alt=\"\" height=\"40\" src=\"/static/icons/cry-of-prowess.webp\" style=\"vertical-align:-8px;margin-right:8px;border:1px solid var(--line)\" width=\"40\"/>\n    \n    Cry of Prowess\n  </h1>\n<p class=\"muted\">\n<a href=\"/classes/paladin\">Paladin</a>\n    \n    · Level 48\n    \n    \n  </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"cols\">\n<div>\n<h2>Effect</h2>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">All allies instantly reach the highest level of their forms ( DC , Stalk , Ranger, BU , Bard)</div>\n<h2>As it was earlier</h2>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n        What guides written while Vanguard was running recorded for this\n        ability. Kept beside the current figures rather than replacing them\n        — the game was rebalanced across its life, so both are right for\n        their own year.\n      </p>\n<dl class=\"facts\">\n<div><dt>Level in 2007-2008</dt>\n<dd>48</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<div class=\"tooltip\">Causes all allies nearby to instantly reach the highest level in their form. Affects the following forms: Dread Knight Dreadful Countenance Rogue Stalking Ranger Fighting Forms Blood Mage Blood Union Bard Dances</div>\n<p class=\"muted small\">\n<a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/2009id_/http://www.tentonhammer.com/node/59402\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">Ten Ton Hammer class guides</a>,\n          \n          2007-2008 ·\n          <a href=\"/abilities/as-it-was\">every ability that changed</a>\n</p>\n<h2>Notes</h2>\n<p class=\"muted\">Confirmed present in the VGO Emulator client: it appears in the Paladin's Adventuring spellbook, captured in full (201 entries over 9 pages) on a level 50 character. The tooltip has not been read, so the figures below still come from the source credited above.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<h2>Details</h2>\n<dl class=\"kv\">\n<div><dt>Level</dt><dd>48</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Energy cost</dt><dd>126</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Endurance cost</dt><dd>20</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Virtue points</dt><dd>0</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Cast time</dt><dd>Instant</dd></div>\n<div><dt>Icon</dt><dd class=\"muted\">Icon411.png</dd></div>\n</dl>\n<h2>Sources</h2>\n<ul class=\"plain\">\n<li><strong>Confirmed to exist in the VGO Emulator</strong>\n<span class=\"muted\">— it appears in the class spellbook,\n              but its tooltip has not been read, so the figures below are still\n              the wikis’</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20211025003636id_/https://vgoplayers.com/wiki/index.php/Paladin\" rel=\"noreferrer nofollow\">vgoplayers wiki (via the Wayback Machine)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin-top:26px\"><a href=\"/abilities\">← All abilities</a></p>\n</main>",
